<title>JAPAN: Ishii Food - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Ishii Food - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  7.98		vs	    8.33</p>
<p> Operating	  321 million	 vs	  171 million</p>
<p> Current	    353 million	 vs	  222 million</p>
<p> Net		  116 million	 vs	  120 million</p>
<p> EPS		    6.33 yen	  vs	    6.54 yen</p>
<p> Shares		18 million	 vs	   18 million</p>
<p> Interim div		  --	  vs		    --</p>
<p>NOTE - Ishii Food Co Ltd is a food processor specialising in seasoned hamburgers.</p>
